WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:03.169 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So everybody is talking about
the reboot of "Roseanne."

00:00:03.169 --> 00:00:05.372 align:start size:94% position:6%
The first few episodes
got huge ratings,

00:00:05.372 --> 00:00:06.806 align:start size:94% position:6%
and it really
seems to have connected

00:00:06.806 --> 00:00:08.141 line:92%
with a large group of people.

00:00:08.141 --> 00:00:09.009 line:92%
So now here to talk about it,

00:00:09.009 --> 00:00:11.845 size:84% position:42%
please welcome two fans
of the show "Roseanne."

00:00:11.845 --> 00:00:14.280 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Hey, Seth!
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:15.582 line:92%
-Thanks for having us, Seth.

00:00:15.582 --> 00:00:19.586
-We are so excited to talk about
our favorite show, "Roseanne."

00:00:19.586 --> 00:00:23.590 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So tell us all,
what is it that you guys love

00:00:23.590 --> 00:00:25.125 line:92%
about "Roseanne" so much?

00:00:25.125 --> 00:00:25.792 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Well, it's simple.

00:00:25.792 --> 00:00:28.595
The networks finally made a show
for people like us.

00:00:28.595 --> 00:00:30.864
-Okay, great. Now, so when
you say "people like us,"

00:00:30.864 --> 00:00:32.532 align:start size:94% position:6%
obviously, you mean
Trump supporters?

00:00:32.532 --> 00:00:34.834 align:start size:94% position:6%
-God, no!
We're talking about people

00:00:34.834 --> 00:00:38.238 align:start size:94% position:6%
who love the sexy,
soulful saxophone journey

00:00:38.238 --> 00:00:40.974 align:start size:94% position:6%
that is the "Roseanne"
theme song.

00:00:40.974 --> 00:00:41.741 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:41.741 --> 00:00:43.109 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I'm sorry.
The theme song?

00:00:43.109 --> 00:00:45.345 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, you know,
the one that goes...

00:00:45.345 --> 00:00:49.049 line:92%
-♪♪ Ba-da ba-da, ba-da, ba-dow ♪♪

00:00:49.049 --> 00:00:50.717 size:81% position:41% line:92%
♪♪ Ba-da-da, da-dow ♪♪

00:00:50.717 --> 00:00:53.920 align:start size:94% position:6%
♪♪ Bow-dow, ba-da ba,
ba-ba-ba bow ♪♪

00:00:53.920 --> 00:00:56.956 line:92%
-[ Imitating harmonica playing ]

00:00:56.956 --> 00:00:58.691 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I'm -- I'm just
gonna cut you off,

00:00:58.691 --> 00:01:00.293 align:start size:94% position:6%
'cause we all know
the theme song.

00:01:00.293 --> 00:01:01.694 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's great.
But I guess my question is,

00:01:01.694 --> 00:01:05.532
what did you think when you
actually watch the show?

00:01:05.532 --> 00:01:07.400 line:92%
-Well, we don't watch the show.

00:01:07.400 --> 00:01:11.838
We watch the theme song,
and then, we turn it off.

00:01:11.838 --> 00:01:13.673 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
-Oh, that's too bad,

00:01:13.673 --> 00:01:15.842 align:start size:94% position:6%
'cause I was hoping
we could talk about the show.

00:01:15.842 --> 00:01:17.143 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know, because a lot of
people are upset

00:01:17.143 --> 00:01:19.946
because they feel as though
the show is giving a platform

00:01:19.946 --> 00:01:21.815 align:start size:94% position:6%
to Roseanne,
who is a Trump supporter

00:01:21.815 --> 00:01:22.715 line:92%
and a conspiracy theorist.

00:01:22.715 --> 00:01:25.852
-Yeah, but a lot of people
like the show because...

00:01:25.852 --> 00:01:29.456 line:92%
♪♪ Ba-da ba-da, ba-da, ba-dow ♪♪

00:01:29.456 --> 00:01:31.224 size:84% position:42% line:92%
♪♪ Ba-da-ba, bew-bow ♪♪

00:01:31.224 --> 00:01:34.627 align:start size:94% position:6%
♪♪ Ba-dow, ba-ga ga,
ga-ga-ga bow ♪♪

00:01:34.627 --> 00:01:35.595 line:92%
-[ Imitating harmonica playing ]

00:01:35.595 --> 00:01:36.830 size:78% position:39%
-Yeah, but I guess --
I think the thing is,

00:01:36.830 --> 00:01:40.166
"Roseanne" has peddled some
pretty dangerous falsehoods,

00:01:40.166 --> 00:01:42.936 size:84% position:42%
not to mention the fact
that the show's success

00:01:42.936 --> 00:01:44.737 align:start size:94% position:6%
probably means
we're about to see a lot more

00:01:44.737 --> 00:01:47.574 align:start size:94% position:6%
sympathetic portrayals
of Trump supporters on TV.

00:01:47.574 --> 00:01:50.009 align:start size:94% position:6%
And even the President himself
has called Roseanne

00:01:50.009 --> 00:01:52.745 align:start size:94% position:6%
to congratulate her
on the success of the show.

00:01:52.745 --> 00:01:56.883 size:84% position:42%
-♪♪ Ba-ba, ba-ba-ba-ba,
ba-ba, ba-ba-ba bow ♪♪

00:01:56.883 --> 00:01:59.152 line:92%
-[ Imitating harmonica playing ]

00:01:59.152 --> 00:02:01.187 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Ah-ha-ha-ha-ha!

00:02:01.187 --> 00:02:06.059 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:06.059 --> 00:02:09.529 line:92%
-Two "Roseanne" fans, everybody.

